<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>You're Pro — Super Flow</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/super-flow-web/favicon.svg">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/super-flow-web/styles.css">
<script is:inline>
  // Bounce focus back into the desktop app; the page stays as a fallback.
  setTimeout(() => { window.location.href = 'super-flow://billing/success' }, 600)
</script>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<section class="band container" style="text-align:center; padding-top: clamp(96px, 14vw, 180px)">
  <span class="eyebrow">payment complete</span>
  <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top:18px">You're on Pro. 🎉</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="max-width:56ch; margin: 22px auto 0">
    Unlimited words, cloud speed, AI cleanup, meetings, and read-aloud are unlocking
    in the app right now — switch back to <b>Super Flow</b> and keep talking.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-cta" style="margin-top:36px">
    <a href="super-flow://billing/success" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Open Super Flow <span class="arr">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:22px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .78rem; color: var(--muted)">
    Receipt sent by email · manage your plan anytime in Settings → Account
  </p>
</section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
